<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">Philemon</book>
  <para style="h">Philemon</para>
  <para style="toc1">Philemon</para>
  <para style="toc2">Philemon</para>
  <para style="mt">Philemon</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paula, Krista Isua mi tâng leh kan unaupa Timothea chuan, kan duh tak leh kan thawh rimpui Philemona hnênah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />kan farnu Aphi hnênah te, kan sipaipui Arkippa hnênah te, i ina kohhran inkhâwmho hnênah te pawh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian kan Pa leh Lalpa Isua Krista hnên ata khawngaihna leh remna in hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa Isua lamah leh mi thianghlim zawng zawng lama hmangaihna leh rinna i neih chu lo hre ṭhînin, ka ṭawngṭainaahte chuan i hming lam fovin, ka Pathian hnênah lâwmthu ka hril ṭhîn;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />i rinna thawhlâwm chu, nangmahnia awm thil ṭha tinrêng hriat famkimna kawngah chuan Krista lama a lo sâwt theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Unaupa, nangma zâra mi thianghlimte thinlung a lo harh tâk avângin i hmangaihnaah chuan ka hlimin ka thlamuang êm êm ṭhîn asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuvângin, a âwm tâwk chu ti tûrin thu pêk che Kristaah ngam êm êm mah ila,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />hmangaihna avângin (Paula, putar meuh ka ni a, tûnah Krista Isua mi tâng ka lo ni ta na a) a ngenin ka ngên zâwk a che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ka fa Onesima, kawl bun chunga ka hrina tân hian i hnênah ka ngensak e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ani chu hmânah khân i tân a ṭangkai lo va, tûnah erawh chuan kei leh nanga tân a ṭangkai ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amah tak, ka thinlung ngei hi i hnênah ka rawn tîr kîr leh ta a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ani chu Chanchin Ṭhaa kawl ka bunnaah hian, nangmah aia rawng mi bâwlsak theihna tûrin ka hnênah awmtîr reng ka duh hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, i khawngaihna chu khawngaih luihtîr ang ni lovin, i thû thû ang a nih theih zâwkna tûrin, i thu lovin eng mah tih ka duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rei lo tê a ṭhen che hi kumkhuaa amah i neih hlenna ai a ni mahna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />nimahsela, bâwih ang ni tawh lova, bâwih aia ṭha, unau duh tak ang zâwk hian; keia tân duh tak a ni bîk a, nanga tân lek phei chuan, tisaah leh Lalpaah chuan a va ni dâwn lehzual êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, ṭhiana mi ngaih chuan keimah angin amah hi lo lâwm ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, i chungah thil eng pawh tisualin emaw, i engilo a bat emaw chuan keima batah ruat ang che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />kei Paulan keima kut ngeia ka ziak a nih hi, keiman ka rulhsak ang; ka lakah nangmah ngei pawh i inbat bawkzia chu hrilh che zawng ka ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A ni, unaupa, nangmah avângin Lalpaah chuan lâwmna mi neihtîr la; Kristaah chuan ka thinlung tiharh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka sawi aia nasa zâwk mahin i ti ang tih ka hriat avângin, i âwih ringin i hnênah ka ziak a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eng pawh ni sela, chu bâkah thlenna tûr mi lo buatsaihsak bawk ang che; in ṭawngṭainate avângin in hnênah pêk ka ni dâwn tih ka inring si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Epaphra, Krista Isuaa ka tânpuipa hian chibai a bûk a che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />ka hnathawhpui Marka te, Aristarka te, Dema te, Luka te pawhin chutiang bawkin an bûk a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kan Lalpa Isua Krista khawngaihna chu i thlarau hnênah awm rawh se. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
